('pkg1a065fe71a3bfxovl', 'sv1a065fe71a3t8zk1k', 'BM', '', 'BM004', 'BM004', 'BM004D', 'Electrical contact burns: High voltage - without part of limb / limb loss; Includes % TBSA skin grafted, flap cover, fasciotomy +/- /debridement/early skin coverage,follow-up dressings etc. as deemed necessary; Surgical procedures are required for deep burns that are not amenable to heal with dressings alone.', 75000, 'Tier1 (X)', 0, '', '', ''),
